repository-code: "https://github.com/HeshanChen/surge-zeroshot"
abstract: "Code, pre-registered split files, continuous-window evaluation protocol, per-gauge evaluation tables, training logs, sampled reforecast forcing, figure scripts and trained model checkpoints for a recurrent neural network trained on 760 GESLA-3 tide gauges with open atmospheric forcing that forecasts storm surge 1 to 48 hours ahead at gauges and regions never used in training."
keywords:
  - storm surge
  - tide gauges
  - coastal flooding
  - forecasting
  - deep learning
  - transfer to ungauged coasts
  - GESLA-3
  - early warning
